From 6eba7453fb56daba0f49ab28285e39b47aa46efb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christophe Kerello <christophe.kerello@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Jun 2026 15:41:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 536/572] fix(st-spi): move OSPI driver to latest bindings

Move IOM and OSPI nodes on latest upstream bindings.
For IOM node, omm_mm property name has been replaced by memory_map.
For OSPI node, compatible string "st,stm32mp25-omi" has been replaced by
"st,stm32mp25-ospi".

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 2f4ea59457b0a7319dbd938d45439a7c6231b545 fix(st-spi): move OSPI driver to latest bindings]
Change-Id: I6c71afc08bef6b50fe2d541ca65b05fa41192085
Signed-off-by: Christophe Kerello <christophe.kerello@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/583562
Domain-Review: Christophe KERELLO <christophe.kerello@st.com>
Reviewed-by: Christophe KERELLO <christophe.kerello@st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Tested-by: Christophe KERELLO <christophe.kerello@st.com>
Reviewed-by: Maxime MERE <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
---
 drivers/st/spi/stm32_ospi.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/st/spi/stm32_ospi.c b/drivers/st/spi/stm32_ospi.c
index 13add8af47..7224f51d15 100644
--- a/drivers/st/spi/stm32_ospi.c
+++ b/drivers/st/spi/stm32_ospi.c
@@ -122,7 +122,7 @@
 #define _OSPI_MAX_CS		2U
 
 #define _DT_IOM_COMPAT		"st,stm32mp25-omm"
-#define _DT_OSPI_COMPAT		"st,stm32mp25-omi"
+#define _DT_OSPI_COMPAT		"st,stm32mp25-ospi"
 
 #define _FREQ_100MHZ		100000000U
 #define _DLYB_FREQ_50MHZ	50000000U
@@ -1290,7 +1290,7 @@ int stm32_ospi_init(void)
 			return -FDT_ERR_NOTFOUND;
 		}
 
-		ret = fdt_get_reg_props_by_name(fdt, iom_node, "omm_mm",
+		ret = fdt_get_reg_props_by_name(fdt, iom_node, "memory_map",
 						&mm_base, &mm_size);
 		if (ret != 0) {
 			return ret;
-- 
